{"event_id":"B3CORR-20261114-002:5","event_sha256":"cff45c36bccfc7b54a8e17a21967083eb236f88199c6f0478ee767a83306f8d3","event_type":"TOOL_RETURNED","payload":{"operation_id":"op-1","result":{"doc":"d3-v010-change-record","heading_path":"D3 v0.10 — CHANGE RECORD > Regression evidence","section_id":"d3-v010-change-record#007","sha256":"6d2dd6c6aa689e67e939fda08603227cef20b74bda2bc95d2e7b7b4de1108142","text":"## Regression evidence\n\n- Full suite re-run after the repairs: **31 fixtures executed, 31 PASS, 0 FAIL** (results.json above). All 31 v0.9 cases preserved — same fixture IDs; the three repaired cases keep their IDs with strengthened assertions.\n- Sabotage runs (implementer-run on scratch copies, discarded after): disabling the fold's trigger-content examination fails exactly FX-R47b; disabling verdict hash validation fails exactly FX-R60b; disabling the missing-reference check fails exactly FX-R65 (reproducing the original defect under the repaired test). Each variant: 30 PASS / 1 FAIL. Detail in FIXTURE-RESULTS-V010.md.\n\n"},"run_id":"B3CORR-20261114-002","step_id":"T02-STEP-01","tool":"shelf_lookup","tree_id":"T02"},"prev_event_sha256":"97af29082a5a7530066a976282512f19a4c31f881acd71aec0c9e106663964d8","recorded_at_utc":"2026-11-14T03:05:43Z","run_id":"B3CORR-20261114-002","seq":5,"step_id":"T02-STEP-01","tree_id":"T02"}
